  "description": "To atone for his brother's crimes, a powerful tiger named Beom becomes the secret guardian of two orphaned siblings, Wol and Myeong. As the years pass and Wol grows into a man, the nightly presence of his fierce yet tender protector begins to stir a different kind of hunger. In this seductive reimagining of an ancient legend, a forbidden romance blooms between a vengeful past and a restless heart. Now, Wol is ready to offer up far more than just a \"rice cake\" to keep the tiger by his side forever.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Part of Lezhin's Jeollaeyahandonghwa (전래야한동화) Collection.*",
